  "rationale": "The posted official agenda (retained-agenda) is titled 'PLANNING AND ZONING COMMISSION WORK SESSION, Tuesday, December 21, 2021' and states 'The Planning and Zoning Commission WORK SESSION will be held...', posted by Irma G. Parker, City Secretary. The provider page (provider-player) titles the video 'Dec 21, 2021 Planning & Zoning Commission Work Session - Addison, TX' and its transcript opens with the meeting being called to order as 'the work session for the Planning and Zoning Commission'; chapter titles (native-source-chapters) mirror the agenda. This proves the convened body is the Addison Planning and Zoning Commission meeting in work session, matching the existing feed addison-tx-planning-and-zoning-commission ('Planning and Zoning Commission meetings for Addison'). A work session of the commission is still a meeting of that commission, so assign_existing applies; no archive_series or exclude_event disposition is warranted. No joint body is proven: the agenda's references to items for the same evening's P&Z Regular Meeting and the transcript's mention of cases forwarded to City Council on December 14 are topical, not evidence that any other body convened or participated. The venue (Addison TreeHouse) and topic words were not used to establish identity, and the Board of Zoning Adjustment feed is a distinct numbered board with no evidence of involvement. No ownership gap remains, so no missing evidence or unresolved disposition is needed."
